{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:52:42+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:52:42+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Boliden AB (publ)","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Other Industrial Metals & Mining","country":"Sweden","city":"Stockholm","website":"https://www.boliden.com","employees":8154,"summary":"Boliden AB (publ) engages in the extracting, producing, and recycling of base metals in Sweden, Finland, other Nordic region, Germany, the United Kingdom, Europe, North America, and internationally. The company operates through Business Area Mines and Business Area Smelters segments. It explores copper, zinc, nickel, lead, gold, silver, cobalt, sulphuric acid, tellurium, platinum, palladium, rhodium, iridium, ruthenium, and osmium deposits. The company operates the Aitik, the Boliden Area, and Garpenberg mines in Sweden; the Tara mine in Ireland; the Kevitsa mines in Finland; the Somincor mine in Portugal; Kokkola smelters in Finland; Odda zinc smelters in Norway; the Rönnskär smelter in Sweden; Harjavalta copper smelters in Finland; and the Bergsöe lead smelter in Sweden. It sells its metals primarily to industrial customers. The company was founded in 1924 and is headquartered in Stockholm, Sweden.","exchange":"Stockholm","currency":"SEK","financial_currency":"SEK","summary_fr":"Boliden AB (publ) s'occupe de l'extraction, de la production et du recyclage des métaux communs en Suède, en Finlande, dans d'autres régions nordiques, en Allemagne, au Royaume-Uni, en Europe, en Amérique du Nord et à l'international. La société opère par le biais des secteurs Mines et Fonderies. Il explore les gisements de cuivre, de zinc, de nickel, de plomb, d'or, d'argent, de cobalt, d'acide sulfurique, de tellure, de platine, de palladium, de rhodium, d'iridium, de ruthénium et d'osmium."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":141952827392,"shares_outstanding":283962452,"trail